@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ЛР 04: група /api/incidents вимагає входу. Login як Morgan (Analyst бачить усі інциденти).
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "morgan", "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}" }

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1 severity summary: expected 200 (was 501 in baseline)
# Contract (Lab 1, variant 2-A):
#   GET /api/incidents/severity-summary[?status=<IncidentStatus>], no request body
#   200 OK, JSON array of { "severity": string, "count": int }, no other fields
#   zero groups: only severities that exist are returned; no incidents -> []
#   order: explicit criticality order Critical, High, Medium, Low (set in code, not by SQL)
#   status: optional, allowlist New|Triaged|InProgress|Resolved|Closed, otherwise 400
# Expected on baseline seed: [High 1, Medium 1, Low 1], no Critical
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary with a valid status: expected 200 [Medium 1]
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary with no matching incidents: expected 200 []
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary with a status outside the allowlist: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Numeric status is not in the allowlist either: expected 400
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=1
Accept: application/json
